    {
      "text": "whom the Father hath sanctified, John 10:36. Sanctify them through thy truth, John 17:17. them which are sanctified by faith that is in me, Acts 26:18 (Ether 4:7). them that are sanctified in Christ Jesus, 1 Cor. 1:2. Jesus, who of God is made unto us … sanctification, 1 Cor. 1:30. sanctified … by the Spirit of our God, 1 Cor. 6:11 (Alma 5:54; 13:12; 3 Ne. 27:20). unbelieving husband is sanctified by the wife, 1 Cor. 7:14 (D&C 74:1). sanctify and cleanse it with the washing of water, Eph. 5:26. possess his vessel in sanctification, 1 Thes. 4:4. God of peace sanctify you wholly, 1 Thes. 5:23. salvation through sanctification of the Spirit, 2 Thes. 2:13. sanctified by the word of God and prayer, 1 Tim. 4:5. who are sanctified are all of one, Heb. 2:11. sanctified through the offering of the body of Jesus, Heb. 10:10. sanctify the people with his own blood, Heb. 13:12. Elect … through sanctification of the Spirit, 1 Pet. 1:2. sanctify the Lord God in your hearts, 1 Pet. 3:15. to them that are sanctified by God the Father, Jude 1:1.",
